<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gen'l Comm begun as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gen'l Comm begun as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said Wednesday it started coverage of General Communication Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set price target of $12 to $15 per share.</p>
<p>-- Set earnings estimates at loss $0.11 per share for 1997, loss $0.11 per share for 1998 and profit $0.11 per share for 1999.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 8-1/8.</p>
</text>
